34
00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:05.148
is this cool Englishman thinking?" Sir Francis wondered. "Is

35
00:03:05.149 --> 00:03:11.236
he planning to boldly snatch the woman from her executioners at the very moment of the sacrifice?" It

36
00:03:11.237 --> 00:03:16.722
was hard to believe that the calm Phileas Fogg could attempt something so desperate. They

37
00:03:16.723 --> 00:03:22.914
crept around the outskirts of the clearing and made their way back to the doors of the pagoda. Concealed

38
00:03:22.915 --> 00:03:28.237
